html=sub(r'<div class="item"><p><b>Today, Tue Nov 24 — giving back, and pickup day:</b>.*?</div>','<div class="item"><p><b>Today, Tue Nov 24 — this evening:</b> <b>Tapas Tuesday at Krissie Vineyards</b>, Shenandoah Rd, Plymouth, until 7:00 PM · the <b>Sierra Oak Farms veggie stand</b> sold its last day at Fiddletown Rd and Mt. Whitney, the <b>Rotary Club</b> packed Thanksgiving boxes in Plymouth this morning, and <b>Baked in Amador&#8217;s preorder pickup</b> ran in Volcano until 3:00 PM (back Wednesday) — see Today in the Foothills for the cards.</p><p class="meta">Source: <a href="https://events.fiddletowngazette.com/">events database</a> published feed · Checked Nov 24</p></div>',html,flags=re.S,label="week today")

html=sub(r'The desk re-checked the home crossing at midday — <b>SR-88 carries no chain control</b>: the CHP CAD board \(updated 12:31 PM today\) holds no SR-88 incident, and Caltrans&#8217; 12:30 PM web report lists no chain-control segment on the approach to Carson Pass — only the tree-work holds near SR-124 and in Pine Grove \(see the Safety Wire\)\.','The desk re-checked the home crossing this evening — <b>SR-88 carries no chain control</b>: the CHP CAD board (updated 5:31 PM today) holds no SR-88 incident, and Caltrans&#8217; 5:28 PM web report lists no chain-control segment on the approach to Carson Pass — the day&#8217;s tree-work holds near SR-124 and in Pine Grove wrapped at 5:00 PM (see the Safety Wire).',html,label="passes")

